{"id":"18.3","doc":"T","title":"Working Modes","words":186,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The "},{"t":"block","v":"SHA","id":"crypto"},{"t":"text","v":" accelerator integrated in ESP32-S3 has two working modes."}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Typical SHA Working Mode: all the data is written and read via CPU directly."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":3,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"DMA-SHA Working Mode: all the data is read via DMA."}]},{"n":4,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"That is, users can configure the DMA controller to read all the data needed for hash operation, thus releasing CPU for completing other tasks."}]}]}]]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":5,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Users can start the SHA accelerator with different working modes by configuring registers "},{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_START_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" and "},{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_DMA_START_REG"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]},{"n":6,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"For details, please see Table 18.3-1."}]}]},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 18.3-1. SHA Accelerator Working Mode","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"Working Mode"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Configuration Method"}]],"rows":[{"n":7,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Typical SHA"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Set "},{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_START_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" to 1"}]]},{"n":8,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"DMA-SHA"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Set "},{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_DMA_START_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" to 1"}]]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":9,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Users can choose hash algorithms by configuring the "},{"t":"reg","v":"SHA_MODE_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" register."}]},{"n":10,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"For details, please see Table 18.3-2."}]}]},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 18.3-2. SHA Hash Algorithm Selection","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"Hash Algorithm"}],[{"t":"text","v":"SHA_MODE_REG Configuration"}]],"rows":[{"n":11,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"SHA-1"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0"}]]},{"n":12,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"SHA-224"}],[{"t":"text","v":"1"}]]},{"n":13,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"SHA-256"}],[{"t":"text","v":"2"}]]},{"n":14,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"SHA-384"}],[{"t":"text","v":"3"}]]},{"n":15,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"SHA-512"}],[{"t":"text","v":"4"}]]},{"n":16,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"SHA-512/224"}],[{"t":"text","v":"5"}]]},{"n":17,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"SHA-512/256"}],[{"t":"text","v":"6"}]]},{"n":18,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"SHA-512/t"}],[{"t":"text","v":"7"}]]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":19,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Notice: ESP32-S3's Digital Signature (DS) and HMAC Accelerator (HMAC) modules also call the SHA accelerator."}]},{"n":20,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Therefore, users cannot access the SHA accelerator when these modules are working."}],"warn":true}]}]}